asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunClownshot = A projectile capable of sending clowns, and only clowns, flying away.
asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunPulse = Throws back enemies a fair distance.
asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunDetain = Causes large amounts of stamina damage.
asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunExecute = A highly damaging, and slightly radioactive bolt. Great for putting things down.
asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunHotshot = A firey bolt, capable of lighting foes on fire.
asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunSleepshot = A lightly-damaging bolt, capable of removing stimulants from a targets system, and inducing drowsiness.
asmb-desc-BulletEnergyGunBigshot = While dealing less damage to living creatures, this bolt is especially effective at tearing apart structures.
